2.Count the odd numbers between 1 to 100 and print
class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 1; i <= 100; i++) {
            if (i % 2 != 0) {
                count++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Count of odd numbers between 1 and 100 = " + count);
    }
}
output
Count of odd numbers between 1 and 100 = 50

